## **2. Purpose**

This schema defines the **machine‑readable structure** for all manifold descriptors referenced in:

- **Manifold Atlas v1.0**  
- **Manifold Routing Rules v1.0**  
- **Manifold Atlas Validation Manifest JSON v1.0**  

It enforces:

- humane manifold grammar  
- stability ecology structure  
- NDH‑external boundaries  
- drift‑neutrality  
- expressive‑layer correctness  

It does **not** activate solvers, spectral geometry, or sealed layers.

---

# **3. Machine‑Readable Schema (v1.0)**

```json
{
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "title": "ManifoldDescriptor_v1_0",
  "description": "Machine-readable descriptor schema for Serenity-Spectral-Runtime manifolds.",
  "type": "object",

  "required": [
    "manifold_id",
    "category",
    "role",
    "stability_ecology",
    "traversal_notes",
    "ndh_external",
    "non_activation"
  ],

  "properties": {
    "manifold_id": {
      "type": "string",
      "pattern": "^MAN_[A-Z0-9_]+$"
    },

    "category": {
      "type": "string",
      "enum": [
        "onboarding",
        "working",
        "spectral_adjacent",
        "safety"
      ]
    },

    "role": {
      "type": "string",
      "minLength": 1
    },

    "stability_ecology": {
      "type": "object",
      "required": [
        "stability",
        "drift",
        "emotional_geometry"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "stability": {
          "type": "string",
          "enum": ["High", "Very High"]
        },
        "drift": {
          "type": "string",
          "enum": ["Neutral", "Low"]
        },
        "emotional_geometry": {
          "type": "string",
          "enum": ["Safe", "Mild", "Aesthetic", "Neutral"]
        }
      }
    },

    "traversal_notes": {
      "type": "string",
      "minLength": 1
    },

    "ndh_external": {
      "type": "boolean",
      "const": true
    },

    "non_activation": {
      "type": "boolean",
      "const": true
    }
  }
}
```

